<line></line>
<line><in>stats</in></line>
<line><ci>Lower side <in>p_l</in></ci>  (H<sub>1</sub>: differences tend to be less than zero)</line>
<line><ci>Upper side <in>p_u</in></ci>  (H<sub>1</sub>: differences tend to be greater than zero)</line>
<line><ci>Two sided <in>p_2</in></ci>  (H<sub>1</sub>: differences tend not to be zero)</line>
